---
import Navbar from "@/components/layout/Navbar.astro";
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="写作后台已迁移" description="写作功能已迁移到独立内容后台">
	<meta slot="head" name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow,noarchive" />
	<div id="top-row" class="z-50 pointer-events-none relative transition-all duration-700 mx-auto h-18 fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-80 w-full xl:w-[92vw] max-w-(--page-width) px-0 md:px-4"><div id="navbar-wrapper" class="pointer-events-auto transition-all"><Navbar /></div></div>
	<main class="legacy-write card-base"><h1>写作后台已迁移</h1><p>旧 WriteManager 已退出运行路径。文章和动态现在统一使用独立实时内容后台。</p><a href="/admin/?section=posts">进入内容后台</a></main>
</Layout>
<script is:inline>if(window.location.pathname.endsWith("/write/"))window.location.replace("/admin/?section=posts");</script>
<style>.legacy-write{position:relative;z-index:30;width:min(92vw,42rem);margin:7rem auto 2rem;padding:1.2rem}.legacy-write h1{margin:0}.legacy-write p{opacity:.65}.legacy-write a{color:var(--primary);font-weight:700}</style>
